# Build output and machine-local wiring. Everything under gen/ is produced by
# `tauri android init` from tauri.conf.json plus the sources in android-src/, so it
# is reproducible and would otherwise add tens of thousands of generated lines to
# review.
#
# The hand-written Activity and JNI bridge are in android-src/, not here:
# scripts/android_project.py puts them into the generated project on every build, and
# `python scripts/android_project.py ensure` rebuilds the whole project from scratch.
target/
gen/
gen-old/
node_modules/
*.apk
*.aab
*.idsig
